#: scenario3:scenario3_14DC029D_6F9B_49C6_ABBB_63AC9DE30A9D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 59527dbbe8a1e94e2d68f752d98bfe46ee3c92aae122803751d49af28d3234b2
#. default-sha256: 3ec47b18738ebdd6822afb22c93a84784a0c6e910816cd0c963402ed08c9712f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_14DC029D_6F9B_49C6_ABBB_63AC9DE30A9D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫The White-Haired Girl’s persistent letters did not "
"improve anything—⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫but simply stoked the flames of misunderstanding."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Le continue lettere della Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi non "
"erano affatto d’aiuto—⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫non facevano altro che alimentare l’equivoco."

#: scenario3:scenario3_0230BE86_680D_4245_A157_96799FD22D51
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d4fc6f4950c97519bbbb85b2cf131d861f88db486dbafac9f535a19184bf9af1
#. default-sha256: 93fd0af9e4e6b4cfe28d2e00755bf0d27685561b93c10d7a15995d89a657476d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0230BE86_680D_4245_A157_96799FD22D51"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This continued for several months. ⟪k:1⟫Though outside, the sun shone with the gentle warmth "
"of spring, the cold, bitter winds of winter still relentlessly blew between Jacopo and his wife."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ciò continuò per diversi mesi. ⟪k:1⟫Anche se fuori il sole splendeva nel dolce tepore della "
"primavera, tra Jacopo e sua moglie continuava a soffiare un vento gelido e pungente."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D9FE6E02_E421_4202_B548_271051E2306F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 42cc7b4f7ebac774c2d4fa28e941393b524a5c563a488742e4f1ebf30e55cc88
#. default-sha256: 5a516544e86273ef654ea3a7e9c449f7787705885737cd6012fc8f34dae77708
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D9FE6E02_E421_4202_B548_271051E2306F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not allowed to leave her shed and never receiving a reply to her letters, the White-Haired "
"Girl’s only source of information was Maria."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non potendo lasciare il capanno, e non avendo ricevuto alcuna risposta alle sue lettere, "
"l’unica fonte di informazioni per la Ragazza⟪k:1⟫dai Capelli Bianchi era Maria."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9295EFCA_DFA1_49EC_BEA6_19A4B3F31568
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0776a1f991d932cbc1136ad4fb806c03c2864693ae36e4946827338b81c8418c
#. default-sha256: 29f267b442afaa938564a3f127bcb2bafc8777f426ec343af4bd29f8450edd6f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9295EFCA_DFA1_49EC_BEA6_19A4B3F31568"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Week after week, her circumstances remained the same, but something else was beginning to "
"show signs of change:"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Settimana dopo settimana, le circostanze erano ancora le stesse,⟪k:1⟫ma qualcos’altro aveva "
"iniziato a mostrare segni di cambiamento:"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4A531797_C484_4ED8_99AD_E9EF3E48E268
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 54407ab8c7fda98d62aaf888dd43b16d3df3b8fe6e724ded94a020261a743b0d
#. default-sha256: a6a4545a1aecdc946bbaf0b6e16c4bdc2b8b47298e5ddb6ccafc888f341cc858
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4A531797_C484_4ED8_99AD_E9EF3E48E268"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Her mental state."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫il suo stato mentale."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3AFF6045_6BD0_4728_B88A_C236A237AF98
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b9ef92bb1783df6914dca18be0d596f05e04862f00179e0b80e1d8571af3791d
#. default-sha256: 550526fc6c46271b13de7e5434969530199cb5f84902ffac0de9458cacc4e5f5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3AFF6045_6BD0_4728_B88A_C236A237AF98"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫It’s pointless, Madam.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫You’re only wasting "
"your time at this point."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Non serve a nulla, Madam.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Ora come ora "
"stai solo perdendo tempo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_94B1DBAC_9630_4BC1_9E09_AA36E5ED66AD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e79f403bc343c6ffadafcf84c05c773e167e2326cc6087d088bbf698cff21767
#. default-sha256: fd34d8ae2dca11445b9367ce11a2d726a0a3c9552040889f0f33670dfc4f000f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_94B1DBAC_9630_4BC1_9E09_AA36E5ED66AD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I saw him throw your letter into the fireplace."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫L’ho visto mentre gettava le tue lettere nel camino."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7D2C7799_850B_45F7_9E6A_E0B1EB0FCD9F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e7799615f0190663f652dfcbffc76a6deccccc6dff0ab50f2952385c0b79f504
#. default-sha256: 6ea5426a152be1f6cda76662b20fd2a1adf7cfccd262ea9b794082c96fff6658
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7D2C7799_850B_45F7_9E6A_E0B1EB0FCD9F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He’s not going to read anything you write,⟪k:1⟫no matter how much of your soul you pour into "
"it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non ha intenzione di leggere nulla di ciò che scrivi,⟪k:1⟫non importa quanta anima ci metti "
"nel farlo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_398852CA_FECB_4B42_9AE6_2A98A8FAF0CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08e02f408ab0624fe2a7aabb3355ed15e7fc9279501e92147d43ca954e01e961
#. default-sha256: 29df0e5914e4cf520bbeeb1390708856480422d92176394afa59e0369940f011
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_398852CA_FECB_4B42_9AE6_2A98A8FAF0CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He cares more about money and work than love.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That’s the kind of man he is."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Gli interessano più i soldi dell’amore.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫È⟪k:4⟫ questo il tipo di uomo che è "
"tuo marito."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9BE94E12_B9CD_4744_B4A9_8539814B0F6E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ba916bd91c8477c537f64b48e3f4a47141dc06e51daddd20ee2b16da753764da
#. default-sha256: c943fae0213e0ed4a8665328c437522eece7a45293ecba85923fad37088c631d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9BE94E12_B9CD_4744_B4A9_8539814B0F6E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Just give up and file for divorce already."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫È⟪k:2⟫ ora che tu lo accetti e che chieda il divorzio."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A91AFD46_E069_4D31_87C9_0F5F3C8AA71E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
