"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Well, I guess you always have been kind of mushy, haven’t you?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫True to your "
"heart, despite how you may look.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫That’s not a bad thing, though, in my book."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Beh, immagino che tu sia sempre stato un tipo sdolcinato, non è vero?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Fedele "
